-CASE UnicodeEscapeBounds
-STATEMENT RETURN "\uFFFF" = "\U0000FFFF"
---- 1
True
-STATEMENT RETURN size("\U0010FFFF")
---- 1
1
-STATEMENT RETURN "\U00110000"
